disimpan di localStorage browser dan request dikirim langsung ke provider.</small></div><label class="form-label">Logo (opsional)</label><input id="company-logo" type="file" accept="image/*" class="form-control form-control-sm"><div id="logo-preview" class="mt-2"></div></div><div class="modal-footer"><button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary">Simpan Pengaturan</button></div></form></div></div></div>

